[38;5;153m❯[39m [38;5;246m1.[39m [38;5;153mWord boundary + fallback (Recommended)[39m
     [38;5;246mCut at the last space before the budget; fall back to a hard cut when a single word is already too long. Better [39m
     [38;5;246mprose output, ~4 lines more than the hard cut.[39m
